# --- generated run artefacts ---
# traces/probe.duckdb IS committed: `make eval` on a fresh clone reproduces the
# results table from it, which is the reproducibility contract in DELIVERABLES.
# Scratch runs and write-ahead logs are not.
traces/scratch/
traces/*.duckdb.wal
traces/*.duckdb.tmp/
!traces/probe.duckdb
# The live Haiku run, kept beside the offline store rather than replacing it:
# the two are different measurement instruments and the README says so.
!traces/probe-haiku.duckdb
analysis/results/scratch/
*.log
